# Shared UI (majburiy)

Yangi UI yozganda avval `src/components/ui` ni ishlating. Bir xil narsani sahifada qayta stil qilmang.

## Majburiy komponentlar

| Vazifa | Komponent |
|--------|-----------|
| Tugma / filter chip | `Button` (`primary` `secondary` `outline` `soft` `ghost` `danger`; `sm` `md` `lg` `icon` `icon-sm`; `active` `loading`) |
| Ko‘rish / tahrir / o‘chirish / export / qo‘shish | `ShowButton` `EditButton` `DeleteButton` `ExportButton` `AddButton`. Header filter: `DateInput size="sm"` + `SearchInput` + `ExportButton`/`AddButton`. Sahifada `Eye`/`Pencil`/`Trash2`/`FileSpreadsheet` qayta yozilmasin |

| Tab / segment | `Tabs` (`items`, `value`, `onChange`; `size` `sm\|md`; `fullWidth`) |
| Sahifalash | `Pagination` (`page` `totalPages` `onPageChange`; ixtiyoriy `total` `pageSize` `onPageSizeChange`) |
| Bo‘sh holat | `EmptyState` |
| Xato matni | `ErrorMessage` |
| Status chip | `Badge` |
| Oq panel | `Panel` |
| Jadval | `Table` `HeaderTR` `FilterTR` `FilterTH` `TableSearch` `EmptyTR` `TBody` `TR` `TH` `TD`. Sahifada boshqa jadval yoki EmptyState-in-TD yozilmasin. Badge `className` bilan qayta stil qilinmasin. |
| Qidiruv | `SearchInput` (onChange default 1000ms debounce; lokal filter: `debounceMs={0}`) |
| Select / filter | `Select` (qidiruvli custom dropdown) |
| Tashkilot filter | `OrganizationSelect` (eski `OrganizationFilterC`: INN qizil, `GET v2 /organizations/list`) |
| Modal | `Modal` |
| Tasdiqlash (o‘chirish) | `ConfirmDialog` (doim «Haqiqatdan tasdiqlaysizmi?») |
| Ko‘rsatish maydonlari | `DetailList` |
| Forma input | `Input` |
| Ko‘p qatorli matn | `Textarea` |
| Belgilash / qator tanlash | `Checkbox` |
| Sana | `DateInput` (qo‘lda DD.MM.YYYY + kalendar; value ISO) |
| Telefon | `PhoneInput` (`+998(xx) xxx-xx-xx`) |
| Loading | `Skeleton` / `SkeletonCard` / `SkeletonLines` yoki tayyor skeletonlar |
| Xabar / toast / banner | `Notification` (inline) + `notify.success|error|info|warning` |

Import: `import { Button, Tabs, Pagination, Notification, notify, ConfirmDialog, … } from '@/components/ui'`

- Header filter: `DateInput size="sm"`, `SearchInput`, `Select`, `ExportButton`, `AddButton` — bir qator, `items-end`.
- **Balandlik:** `Input` `Select` `DateInput` `SearchInput` `PhoneInput` `ExportButton` `AddButton` `Button` — doim `h-9` (`CONTROL_HEIGHT`). `size="sm"|"md"` faqat label/padding, control balandligi emas.
- O‘chirish **doim** `ConfirmDialog` orqali. Ad-hoc `Modal` + tasdiq matni yozilmasin.

## Qoida

- Yangi sahifa/feature da raw `button` + ad-hoc Tailwind pagination/empty/tab **taqiqlanadi** (maxsus interaktiv kartadan tashqari).
- Paginationli ro‘yxat/jadvalda **doim** `Pagination` (default `hideIfSingle=false`).
- Qidiruv: faqat `SearchInput`. Yozish darhol ko‘rinadi, `onChange`/API **1 soniya** (`SEARCH_DEBOUNCE_MS`) keyin. Sahifada qayta debounce yozilmasin. Lokal filter (sidebar, darslar): `debounceMs={0}`. Har harfda fetch **taqiqlanadi**.
- `Table` **doim** ustun ko‘rinishi («Ustunlar») menyusini chiqaradi. Sahifada qayta yozilmasin.
- Ro‘yxat sahifasi: `Header` + `PageMain fill` — jadval header ostidagi qolgan canvasni to‘ldiradi.
- `PageMain fill` ichida: `Table` to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri yoki `flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col` wrapperda; `Pagination` alohida `shrink-0` sibling. `Table`+`Pagination` ni bitta non-flex `space-y-*` divga o‘rash **taqiqlanadi** (scroll kesiladi).
- Jadval **doim** `Table`: 1-qator `HeaderTR` (nomlar), 2-qator `FilterTR` + `FilterTH` + `TableSearch`/`Select`. Bo‘sh: `EmptyTR`. `THead` ichidagi `TR` ham shu stillarni oladi.
- Ustun filtrlari: 1-qator nomlar, 2-qator `FilterTH` (sarlavha bilan bir katakka siqilmasin).
- Takrorlanadigan UI (tab, select, search, jadval…) — avval shared kit; yo‘q bo‘lsa `components/ui` ga qo‘shib, keyin ishlat.
- Muvaffaqiyat / xato / ogohlantirish: toast uchun `notify.*`; sahifa ichidagi hint/banner uchun `<Notification tone="…" />`. Ad-hoc amber/signal Panel qayta yozilmasin.
- Ranglar faqat theme tokenlar (`signal`, `mist`, `deep`…).
